==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Snubbull|137}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

